# Environment variables
.env
.dev.vars
# Local backup of the online project's secrets, made when .env was repointed at
# the local Supabase stack for testing. Deliberately NOT named .env.local: Vite's
# loadEnv() reads .env.local and would shadow the local-stack values in tests.
.env.remote

